*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 026011C-N75
* Inductance = 0.75nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1kHz-35MHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 026011C-N75 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.029pF Ind=0.75nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=10
+ R2=0.03
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.000003
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 026011C-N75

